Hello dear

My name is Ms. Rosalie Charles, widow with stage 4 cancer. I saw your email
in my search for someone I can trust to assist and utilize the proceeds
realized from my estates and investments for charity, basically helping the
less privileged, widows and orphans because according to the doctors my
days are numbered. So don't be surprised reading from me today but consider
this a divine intervention.

I am willing to give you a substantial part of the funds for your personal
and family needs, so give me your word never to betray my trust. I desire
to entrust the money in your care and it is my last wish to use this money
strictly for charity thus, I seek a sincere heart to actualize this as my
health no longer permits me. I have to rest now and will explain further
when I hear from you.

Regards,
Ms. Rosalie Charles.

